Basenor
). The post also says the service has expanded to Miami, Orlando and Tampa, which conflicts with a Oct 14 post on X saying Austin is still the only city with Cybercab service (
AGTP on X
), so I treat it as weak. A Sept 30 FOX 7 Austin story says Austin fire officials were preparing for rain. It quotes a fire division chief saying 
"We're not sure how well all of them can manage still or sort of floodwaters"
, and it reports no Cybercab rain performance (
